        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>I don't really know where this may go and its kind of an odd question so I figured this would be the best place. &nbsp;I was wondering if there was a villain that \"acted\" mechanically at least similar to any villain. &nbsp;I don't care about their story lines, I just looking for the mechanics to be similar, I can't think of a example.... Maybe something like Unity with her golems and... any minion based villain.. &nbsp;I've played the game just a few times, enough to make that rough parallel but not enough to see any other BETTER parallels. &nbsp;I hope someone can come up with something more substantial. &nbsp;Thanks in advance.</p>",
